# ADR-deviation marker — fix/publish-workflow-substrate-bundling
- date: 2026-08-30
- branch: fix/publish-workflow-substrate-bundling
- adr_governing: ADR-004 (publish pipeline safety) + ADR-007 (substrate bundling)
- outcome: ADR-honored
- rationale: |
    ADR-004 §D3 belt-and-suspenders on --ignore-scripts stays intact.
    ADR-007 §D3 amendment records the mechanism change: bundling runs
